    <forecast>
        <area aac="SA_FA001" description="South Australia" type="region">
            <forecast-period start-time-local="2026-11-22T15:55:41+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-22T15:55:41+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-22T05:25:41Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-22T05:25:41Z">
                <text type="warning_summary_footer">For latest warnings go to www.bom.gov.au, subscribe to RSS feeds, call 1300 659 210* or listen for warnings on relevant TV and radio broadcasts.</text>
                <text type="synoptic_situation">A trough of low pressure over the northeast will linger over the far northeast until mid week. A cold front clips the southeast on Monday, followed by a high pressure system, which will then move across southern parts of the state on Tuesday. A trough of low pressure approaches the western border on Wednesday whilst a cold font moves over waters to the south. The trough lingers near the western border on Thursday whilst a high pressure systems moves over waters to the south.</text>
                <text type="product_footer">* Calls to 1300 numbers cost around 27.5c incl. GST, higher from mobiles or public phones.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
        <area aac="SA_PW010" description="West Coast" type="public-district" parent-aac="SA_FA001">
            <forecast-period index="0" start-time-local="2026-11-22T15:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-23T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-22T04:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-22T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Mostly clear. Winds west to southwesterly 25 to 35 km/h tending south to southwesterly 15 to 25 km/h in the evening.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="1" start-time-local="2026-11-23T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-24T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-22T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-23T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Winds south to southwesterly 15 to 25 km/h increasing to 25 to 35 km/h in the morning then tending south to southeasterly 15 to 25 km/h in the late evening. Overnight temperatures falling to around 13 with daytime temperatures reaching 22 to 27.</text>
                <text type="fire_danger">High</text>
                <text type="uv_alert">Sun protection 9:10am to 5:30pm, UV Index predicted to reach 12 [Extreme]</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="2" start-time-local="2026-11-24T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-25T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-23T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-24T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Mostly sunny. Winds east to southeasterly 15 to 20 km/h tending east to northeasterly 15 to 25 km/h in the morning then tending east to southeasterly in the late evening. Overnight temperatures falling to between 8 and 12 with daytime temperatures reaching around 30.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="3" start-time-local="2026-11-25T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-26T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-24T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-25T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Medium chance of showers west of Ceduna in the afternoon and evening. Near zero chance of rain elsewhere. The chance of a thunderstorm west of Ceduna. Winds east to northeasterly 20 to 30 km/h tending northwest to northeasterly 25 to 35 km/h during the morning then tending southeast to southwesterly 15 to 25 km/h during the evening. Overnight temperatures falling to between 9 and 17 with daytime temperatures reaching the low to mid 30s.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="4" start-time-local="2026-11-26T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-27T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-25T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-26T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Slight chance of a shower. The chance of a thunderstorm in the morning. Winds south to southeasterly 15 to 20 km/h tending east to southeasterly during the morning then tending south to southeasterly 20 to 30 km/h during the day. Overnight temperatures falling to around 16 with daytime temperatures reaching 26 to 34.</text>
            </forecast-period>
